# the editor UI with the node graph
time 0.36
pos 144 136 -368
look 90 4
ui on
settle
drag 800 539 800 39 20         # World Generator: move up...
drag 1906 566 1906 1066 20     # ...and make it full height
cursor 400 184                 # open the temperate zone graph
click left
wait 10
